  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6be0970de54a47b42ad80671ee1961d7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SickFairyNpc
  fairyName: Little Fairy
  flapFrames:
  - {fileID: 1655388160, guid: b037823e24a4da945b65b6f22efb71ae, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -2024271336, guid: b037823e24a4da945b65b6f22efb71ae, type: 3}
  fallFrame: {fileID: -240867058, guid: b037823e24a4da945b65b6f22efb71ae, type: 3}
  lieFrames:
  - {fileID: -945797005, guid: b037823e24a4da945b65b6f22efb71ae, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1461827285, guid: b037823e24a4da945b65b6f22efb71ae, type: 3}
  sitFrame: {fileID: 1459720732, guid: b037823e24a4da945b65b6f22efb71ae, type: 3}
  portraitIdle: {fileID: 1743590539, guid: 6b329ea8a1a136f43a189d09e256187e, type: 3}
  portraitTalk: {fileID: 1632680642, guid: 6b329ea8a1a136f43a189d09e256187e, type: 3}
  portraitHappy: {fileID: -1357688451, guid: 6b329ea8a1a136f43a189d09e256187e, type: 3}
  portraitBlink: {fileID: -1805281499, guid: 6b329ea8a1a136f43a189d09e256187e, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 031b059d99820c5458641095e4070c10, type: 3}
  portraitFrame: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 596599fae9cbc8c4386d6ff2e60a29f2, type: 3}
  nameColor: {r: 0.42, g: 0.58, b: 0.5, a: 1}
  glowColor: {r: 0.65, g: 0.85, b: 0.75, a: 0.22}
  lieSeconds: 4.5
  riseSeconds: 1.3
  struggleSeconds: 1.1
  riseHeight: 1.5
  gravity: 16
  groundOffset: 0.75
  firstMeeting:
  - ...Oh. Is someone there? Please, don't be afraid of me.
  - I tried to fly out of the maze to find help. But the pollution is in the air here... my wings won't hold me. I keep falling.
  - My sister keeps the grove at the far end of the maze. The shadows are getting worse and she cannot face them alone.
  - Please... will you go to her? Will you help her?
  thanks:
  - Thank you... thank you. I knew the forest would send someone.
  - Talk to me if you get lost. I can't fly, but I can still feel the paths.
  whatHappened:
  - The dark seeped up from the farm and the mountain. It crept into the roots first, and then into us.
  - My sister is stronger than I am. She stayed to hold the grove together. I was only supposed to fetch a helper...
  - (She coughs weakly.) I'm all right. I just need to rest. Lots of resting.
  aboutSister:
  - My sister is the keeper of the grove. She is taller than me, and much more serious, and she hums when she's worried.
  - The grove is the only place the pollution has not reached. It's at the end of the maze, past the very last gate. Look for the fireflies.
  noGuide:
  - I can feel the path, but it's tangled... Go deeper into the maze, through the gates. Every gate has a stump that holds its key.
